<title>USA: US Treasury's year bills seen at 5.66 pct.</title>
<headline>US Treasury's year bills seen at 5.66 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Treasury's sale of $13.75 billion in year bills on Wednesday is expected to produce average rates of 5.66 percent, traders said.</p>
<p>In when-issued trade at around 1110 EST/1610 GMT, year bill rates were quoted at 5.652 percent.</p>
<p>The bidding deadline for the auction is 1130 EST/1630 GMT. Results are expected around 1215 EST/1715 GMT.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1663 ))</p>
